"""idler_riser_exact: CadQuery construction script generated by stl2cad (exact mode).

The part is rebuilt from the surfaces fitted to the mesh. Each surface in SURFACES is
extended past its region; together they cut the box BOX into cells, and the cells that
contain a point of INSIDE form the part. FILLETS then re-applies the fillets (radius and
edge midpoint) and TORI makes the circular fillets exact tori. Units: mm.
Edit a parameter (a radius r, a plane offset, a cylinder axis) and re-run;
keep each edit small enough that every INSIDE point stays inside the part.
Run:  python idler_riser_exact.py [out.step]
"""

